                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 方正公文小标宋;font-size: 20pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 20pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">关于开展6月份支部主题党日活动的通知</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各支部：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为隆重庆祝中国共产党成立101周年，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据上级部门要求，结合学校实际</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，经研究，决定组织开展6月份支部主题党日活动，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、活动主题：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">明悟初心守根脉、聚焦育人办实事</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、活动形式：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">集中学习与个人自学相结合</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、活动时间：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6月27日（周一下午第八、九节）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>四、活动地点：</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各支部活动室</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>五、学习内容：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.重温入党誓词。</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各党支部组织党员重温入党誓词，引导党员坚定信念、对党忠诚塑造政治之魂，勇于担当、善作善成担负时代使命。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.主题微党课宣讲。</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各党支部组织党员教师观看党课视频《我们的征途是星辰大海》。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.组织“党课下基层”活动。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校领导到联系支部讲党课，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各支部联系领导以“学习省</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第十五次党代会精神</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”为主题为支部全体党员上一堂党课。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.开展一轮师生志愿服务。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深化推进“三服务”工作，组织党员教师开展一轮集中家校沟通服务，聚焦“三特”学生帮扶，准确回应学生心灵需求，把准学生家长诉求，对不同年级学生的不同需要，落实“个性化服务清单”。各支部要充分发挥学科专业优势和丰富育人经验，协同年级组开展“高一选课指导”“高二学考辅导”“高三高校志愿填报帮扶”等多样化服务。要立足校园疫情防控，发挥党员先锋模范作用。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 29.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.45in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>5.做好集中走访慰问。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校党委要在“七一”前集中开展1次走访慰问，传递组织温暖、送上组织关怀。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>六、注意事项：</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.本周“每周一学”活动可结合主题党日活动开展。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">请党员教师在《党员学习笔记》上作好学习记录。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.请各支部严肃组织纪律，做好活动签到、拍照留档等工作，活动结束及时上报</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>图文</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">资料给党政办。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中共绍兴市第一中学委员会</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2022年6月27日</span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
